          "y": 6784,
          "width": 788,
          "height": 286,
          "order": 7,
          "type": "text",
          "text": " Every day, they get a little more faded. \n\nEvery day, \n\nthey get a little closer to disappearing. \n\nThis makes them exciting to watch.",
